# Runner-specific context: exclude unrelated applications and local state.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/
apps/*/**
!apps/*/package.json
!apps/convex/**
!packages/
!packages/**
!patches/
!patches/**
!deployments/
!deployments/convex/
!deployments/convex/runner/
!deployments/convex/runner/**
# Final exclusions override every allow rule, including nested package paths.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.secrets
**/secrets
**/credentials
**/*credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*.log
